				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Now, of course, the fun doesn’t stop here. So far, GT understands our language syntactically: it can parse it, color it, and send it off to be run. To really work with it, GT will have to understand it semantically, and the easiest way to get there is to ask the compiler."
